    "silhouette": "Hostile spawn structure: one continuous dark armour U (eight hitbox cells) around a free 2 x 2 brood pit, opening toward the defended base. A raised grey frame and dashed violet light strips run along every edge like on the enemy base; rough void brood, a brood heart and two chitin hooks sit inside the strips.",
