    "anatomy": "Strict orthographic plan view, no ground or baked shadow. 1 BU = one 32 px cell; the pivot is the pit centre; the canvas covers 4.25 x 4.25 cells. Intact, damaged and rubble states x four opening directions share one canvas; emission is authored only on the veins and the heart."
  },
